{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_title", "source_sha256": "48db75ca8e0ebf857f82219e683ec893975e7ac8492bebeccde6b30cabf8316e", "ja": "相応しき者", "zh": "适任者", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_synopsis", "source_sha256": "573e483ba9a4849888a5664223f36cb1c571c0e462bb062cf438008318a5d43b", "ja": "次回センターの座を賭け、瑞希とジュリアの\n勝負が始まる。貴音が考えた謎のお題に、\n木の葉のごとく翻弄されるふたり。瑞希の\n熱意に助けられ、最後の課題をクリアした\nジュリアは言った。「勝者はミズキだ」―。", "zh": "为了争夺下次Center的宝座，瑞希与茱莉亚\n展开对决，两人却被贵音出的诡异题目玩弄于\n股掌之上。茱莉亚在瑞希的热情相助之下，\n通过了最后的题目，但茱莉亚却说出──\n「是瑞希赢了。」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1000_p", "source_sha256": "524b2e925e1529e23738ebbefeaaf42aa923b1605a54bf6de63bc6dd9709d95f", "ja": "（瑞希のセンター公演。熱のこもったステージに、\n会場中が胸を打たれた……よくやったぞ、瑞希！）", "zh": "（瑞希的Center公演，是场充满热情的表演，\n打动了会场上下每一位观众……做得好啊，瑞希！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "45e72a16e071bb930893067db53a72778783c64760cbab7601a7187e2db8f7c7", "ja": "{$P$}、みんな、お疲れさまでした。\n全力、出しきったぞ。……いぇい。", "zh": "{$P$}还有各位，辛苦了。\n我全力以赴了……耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "0dc2d4fe4f51062b22982290790aff9e8efde86ffbc71eb522d7bf9a934619ec", "ja": "やったな、ミズキ！\n宣言どおり、最高のステージだったぜ！", "zh": "太好了，瑞希！\n就跟你宣言的一样，这是场最棒的表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "7fda6de342071e6200af1de90ebaf58df1db53976cd4a35a52e374ca787d65e7", "ja": "わ、私……感動して、\n泣きそうになってしまいました……。", "zh": "我、我也……觉得好感动，\n快要哭出来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "16be917ebb06c73089d6f6233787864ee7c9416c34d09393dfe3525bd38d4cd5", "ja": "お疲れさま、瑞希ちゃん。\n本当に、立派なセンターだったよ！", "zh": "辛苦了，瑞希。\n你真的是个很称职的Center喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "a94de942a5ee2943e1b34c39aadb9b580ee93637992ce2c5aa2a0f11462dc841", "ja": "ありがとうございます。けどこれは、私ひとりの\n力ではありません。みんなが、いてくれたからです。", "zh": "谢谢大家。不过，这并不是我一个人独力达成的。\n也要感谢有大家协助。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "817e87b961b420d126be7354d63b51fc7153c9eee971d18adbc6537adacfa651", "ja": "な、何だよミズキ、急に……\n照れるじゃないか。", "zh": "你、你干嘛啦，瑞希？突然说这种话……\n会让人害羞耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "9318585dc08cba0fefc0b64c5c62ea2d30c80870bb00f5357d2aff1bb9dd7c7d", "ja": "本当のことです。\nそれに、四条さんの課題が、役に立ちました。", "zh": "我说的是真的。\n而且，四条姊的题目也有很大的帮助。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d49a510444055334a41d2da6435752f1280db71236aec6d42fe2abc7760bae9e", "ja": "え？　貴音の課題が？", "zh": "什么？贵音的题目？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "45e0c333f8af98321375a783fc6bd262b7a598470cdc970a9743f585c3b561be", "ja": "はい。あのセンター対決の後、みんなで\nサンドバッグを持ち上げられるように特訓して……。", "zh": "是的，上次的Center对决之后，\n大家一起进行了抬沙包的特训……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "12f67350e28f7b4102a328a50ad3d1168b1c56c167d3739abb0adfb9beebf5f3", "ja": "そ、そのおかげで……公演の最後まで、\n息切れしないくらいの体力が、つきました……。", "zh": "所、所以……我们体力增强了，\n唱完整场公演也不会喘不过气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "cc73ec57ec2cfcae08dba97bf41ebc81f746034ac17f34550923c0684f632918", "ja": "落語や他の課題も、舞台度胸や\nリズム感をつけるのに役に立ったしな。", "zh": "落语和其他题目让我们不会怯场，\n也有训练到我们的节奏感呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "2427f80a32c32e79e19680d625f3a32a9b3c71e2642472333c4539769820574b", "ja": "はい。あの課題でヒントをもらっていなければ、\n今日の結果は、違っていたかもしれません。", "zh": "是的，要不是有那些题目给了我们启发，\n今天的结果或许就不会如此成功了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "0af2f116ab082874b4d5235abefaf1979902dfd0a3d30f114076dec7f1af1902", "ja": "四条さんは、それをわかっていたのかな。\n……すごい人です。", "zh": "四条姊是刻意借此帮助我们的吗？\n……她好厉害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1014_008tak", "source_sha256": "c9e7698f1254c0d57ed0f51a840e64c4fd01095e8c002e9c3736025b1dfa17b2", "ja": "瑞希。それに、皆。\n舞台、おつかれさまでした。", "zh": "瑞希，还有各位。\n表演辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "caa044630ed876ed7ead657f05aeea88cff3c0c2db389326e19ff7edf3348998", "ja": "お、ヒメ。ウチらのライブ、\n見ててくれたんだな！", "zh": "哦，公主。\n你有看我们的演唱会吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1016_008tak", "source_sha256": "83dc0f4c0012963325228a1f129cc7c8e43c8d22563e24c7a50147b85cf93115", "ja": "ええ、客席から見ていました。\n実に素晴らしい舞台でした、瑞希。", "zh": "是的，我在观众席欣赏了。\n真的是非常出色的表演，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "24671939243eaebe0400d381e044aaac170be6752f55ecdf84a0d343fd58ca1b", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\n……あの、四条さん。", "zh": "谢谢你。\n……那个，四条姊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1018_008tak", "source_sha256": "2954503d2d1e3a4214aee03c2886c54fa11a37535fc5c2846829b287d0405949", "ja": "なんでしょう。", "zh": "有什么事呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "d1874880befc1a85ad718898afd5ae6f7ff9dbec4eb71e523aa9f768b0df582a", "ja": "決めました。私はいつか、\n四条さんを超えるアイドルになってみせます。", "zh": "我决定了。\n我总有一天会成为超越四条姊的偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "784cdbc590f40bf05880072fea4df0148eba20c945129858eac663940c2fb4ca", "ja": "え……ええっ！？\n超えるって、瑞希ちゃん……！", "zh": "什……什么！？\n你说超越吗？瑞希……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1021_045kar", "source_sha256": "62f5487d9f0cd353b8f0edf3e2d2615068162a82a08803f3058677b0e96b2d80", "ja": "そ、それって……瑞希さんから貴音さんへの、\nライバル宣言……ってことですか……？", "zh": "这、这个意思是……\n瑞希宣布要和贵音竞争……是吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1022_044miz", "source_sha256": "163cf4c699e4afb3b59461f58958dae8388bab9ca2c263d1977608988cf26c44", "ja": "はい。……私は今回のセンター公演で、アイドルなら、\nただ憧れているだけではダメだと気づきました。", "zh": "是的……我经过这次的Center公演，\n发现到偶像不能只靠憧憬作为目标。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1023_050jul", "source_sha256": "82d8e2892693ca638cdfb5cf79f4f39c86319e2ae31150edcf1dcaf15d8a7bcc", "ja": "ミズキ……。", "zh": "瑞希……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1025_044miz", "source_sha256": "e2f1d5ce46964aacbda46119a687d798c98535252a320a295dd159737dad2a2c", "ja": "はっ。もしかして、同じ事務所の先輩がライバル……\nというのは、ダメですか？　{$P$}。", "zh": "啊，莫非，将同一间事务所的前辈视为竞争对手……\n这种事情是做不得的吗，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1026_p", "source_sha256": "3a69ac2f38c7ac561c2d6b9f467eb8142efc68ee77e4ee8600af9aa3e06d41c0", "ja": "いや、そんな事はないよ。\nそれに、高い目標があるのはいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "不，没那回事喔。\n而且，有个远大的目标也很不错啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1027_044miz", "source_sha256": "172a8a8cc7599e4f07502002ccda976ed7f55adb68a3f120e7aef70273638983", "ja": "それはよかったです。では、\n{$P$}の許可もおりたところで……。", "zh": "那就太好了。\n那么，既然{$P$}也允许了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1028_044miz", "source_sha256": "fd0ecdc141609511f6a723e28b139aeabe2df42248764e192488644728efada3", "ja": "私の挑戦、受け取ってくれますか？　四条さん。\n……いえ、貴音さん。", "zh": "你愿意接受我的挑战吗，四条姊？\n……不，贵音姊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1029_008tak", "source_sha256": "a2d3740b116a69e3ff3f51697518d45620e014c13cc1fec51918965cb80c1e05", "ja": "はい、もちろん。\nその心意気ごと、受けて立ちましょう。", "zh": "好的，当然没问题。\n你的决心，小女子就接受吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1030_050jul", "source_sha256": "11b5922df33d19c7ef55e0bdad70960f3b0f7ea2225a00ae44df6acedf0bced3", "ja": "ははっ、さすがはヒメだな！\nウチらも負けてられないな、琴葉、カレン！", "zh": "哈哈，不愧是公主！\n看来我们也不能输啊，琴叶、可怜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1031_017kth", "source_sha256": "c0b0cdbed1e28a720e32f9e4d70648fee6037c0967467b33270ca1997a498e3e", "ja": "うん……そうだね、ジュリアちゃん。\nよーしっ、がんばらなくちゃ……！", "zh": "嗯……对啊，茱莉亚。\n好～得努力加油了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1032_045kar", "source_sha256": "3c6abae156f81e3935dbdae9d8419af0d935a92f9450a83e38d9c8df742b4336", "ja": "わ、私も……！", "zh": "我、我也是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1033_p", "source_sha256": "832bf6917a246c870949b9db3204c6d01c4350f5718c1fa64399d527b10378a5", "ja": "（貴音だけじゃない。劇場のみんなと、仲間として。\nそして誰よりも近いライバルとして、切磋琢磨する）", "zh": "（不只是贵音，剧场里的偶像们都是伙伴。\n同时也是比谁都更加亲近的劲敌，互相切磋琢磨。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_025_1034_p", "source_sha256": "b3d16684c022d71e72bf83beef0ea58edd7905a4c0afa953f462f0458da7bde5", "ja": "（瑞希もみんなも、これから益々成長していくだろう。\n先輩という壁を、いつか追い越したいと願って……！）", "zh": "（瑞希和大家往后都会越来越进步吧。\n期许着自己有朝一日能超越前辈……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
